OL,3,GNEWSABus route to restore link between
OL,4,Acity and towns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new bus service is being launched to
OL,7,Fconnect Canterbury with communities
OL,8,Facross South Thanet after a campaign
OL,9,Fsaw more than 800 people sign a
OL,10,Fpetition.
OL,12,FThe new 44 service will provide a link
OL,13,Fbetween Canterbury and communities in
OL,14,FWingham, Sandwich, Cliffsend, Ramsgate
OL,15,Fand Westwood Cross shopping centre from
OL,16,F20 September.
OL,18,FPolly Billington, East Thanet MP, said
OL,19,Fshe had campaigned for more than two
OL,20,Fyears to restore the link, which had
OL,21,Fbeen "overwhelmingly the top priority"
OL,22,Fin a survey of residents.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
