OL,3,GNEWSABus route to restore link between
OL,4,Acity and towns
OL,5,
OL,6,FJoel Mitchell, managing director of
OL,7,FStagecoach South East, said the new
OL,8,Fconnection had been made possible
OL,9,Fthrough careful route planning and
OL,10,Ftimetable work.
